# Struct Tags & JSON di Go

Struct tags adalah metadata string yang ditempel pada field struct. Paling umum digunakan bersama package `encoding/json` untuk mengontrol serialisasi dan deserialisasi JSON.

## Syntax Struct Tags

Struct tag ditulis sebagai raw string literal (backtick) setelah tipe field:

```go
type User struct {
    ID       int    `json:"id"`
    Username string `json:"username"`
    Email    string `json:"email"`
    Password string `json:"-"`        // skip field ini
    Age      int    `json:"age,omitempty"` // skip jika zero value
}
```

## json.Marshal — Struct ke JSON

```go
import "encoding/json"

type Product struct {
    ID    int     `json:"id"`
    Name  string  `json:"name"`
    Price float64 `json:"price"`
    Stock int     `json:"stock,omitempty"`
}

p := Product{ID: 1, Name: "Laptop", Price: 15000000, Stock: 5}

// Marshal ke []byte
data, err := json.Marshal(p)
if err != nil {
    log.Fatal(err)
}
fmt.Println(string(data))
// {"id":1,"name":"Laptop","price":15000000,"stock":5}

// MarshalIndent untuk format yang lebih rapi
pretty, _ := json.MarshalIndent(p, "", "  ")
fmt.Println(string(pretty))
// {
//   "id": 1,
//   "name": "Laptop",
//   "price": 15000000,
//   "stock": 5
// }
```

## json.Unmarshal — JSON ke Struct

```go
jsonData := `{"id":2,"name":"Mouse","price":250000}`

var product Product
err := json.Unmarshal([]byte(jsonData), &product)
if err != nil {
    log.Fatal(err)
}
fmt.Println(product.Name)  // Mouse
fmt.Println(product.Price) // 250000
```

## Tag Options

### `omitempty` — Skip Jika Zero Value

```go
type Response struct {
    Code    int    `json:"code"`
    Message string `json:"message"`
    Error   string `json:"error,omitempty"` // skip jika ""
    Data    any    `json:"data,omitempty"`  // skip jika nil
}

// Tanpa error
resp := Response{Code: 200, Message: "OK"}
data, _ := json.Marshal(resp)
fmt.Println(string(data))
// {"code":200,"message":"OK"}

// Dengan error
resp2 := Response{Code: 400, Message: "Bad Request", Error: "invalid input"}
data2, _ := json.Marshal(resp2)
fmt.Println(string(data2))
// {"code":400,"message":"Bad Request","error":"invalid input"}
```

### `json:"-"` — Skip Field

```go
type User struct {
    ID       int    `json:"id"`
    Username string `json:"username"`
    Password string `json:"-"`      // tidak pernah di-serialize
    Token    string `json:"-,"`     // field bernama "-" (jarang dipakai)
}

u := User{ID: 1, Username: "alice", Password: "secret123"}
data, _ := json.Marshal(u)
fmt.Println(string(data))
// {"id":1,"username":"alice"} — password tidak muncul!
```

## Nested JSON

```go
type Address struct {
    Street string `json:"street"`
    City   string `json:"city"`
    Zip    string `json:"zip"`
}

type Person struct {
    Name    string  `json:"name"`
    Age     int     `json:"age"`
    Address Address `json:"address"`
    Tags    []string `json:"tags,omitempty"`
}

person := Person{
    Name: "Alice",
    Age:  30,
    Address: Address{
        Street: "Jl. Merdeka 1",
        City:   "Jakarta",
        Zip:    "10110",
    },
    Tags: []string{"admin", "user"},
}

data, _ := json.MarshalIndent(person, "", "  ")
fmt.Println(string(data))
```

## Contoh Nyata: API Response Struct

```go
type APIResponse struct {
    Success bool        `json:"success"`
    Code    int         `json:"code"`
    Message string      `json:"message"`
    Data    interface{} `json:"data,omitempty"`
    Error   *APIError   `json:"error,omitempty"`
}

type APIError struct {
    Code    string `json:"code"`
    Message string `json:"message"`
}

type UserDTO struct {
    ID        int    `json:"id"`
    Username  string `json:"username"`
    Email     string `json:"email"`
    CreatedAt string `json:"created_at"`
}

func successResponse(data interface{}) APIResponse {
    return APIResponse{
        Success: true,
        Code:    200,
        Message: "OK",
        Data:    data,
    }
}

func errorResponse(code, msg string) APIResponse {
    return APIResponse{
        Success: false,
        Code:    400,
        Message: "Error",
        Error:   &APIError{Code: code, Message: msg},
    }
}

user := UserDTO{1, "alice", "alice@example.com", "2024-01-01"}
resp := successResponse(user)
data, _ := json.MarshalIndent(resp, "", "  ")
fmt.Println(string(data))
```

## Decode JSON ke Map

```go
// Jika tidak tahu struktur JSON sebelumnya
var result map[string]interface{}
jsonStr := `{"name":"Alice","age":30,"active":true}`
json.Unmarshal([]byte(jsonStr), &result)
fmt.Println(result["name"]) // Alice
```

